# From 1.0: its settings (format 3) and journeys (format 5) come over. The FX page keeps its eight (SIZE
# as it was set) and gets the new eight as made; the journey keeps its scene, its scenes take the FX
# page's space (ROOM and HALO 0%: 1.0's unused bytes are not read), the drone moves as it did and TIDES
# come as made; every voice in the middle, nothing swaying (PAN's bytes were spare). The user slot too.
legacy10
wait 500
expect set_format 4
expect fx1 70
expect fx0 91
expect fx8 64
expect fx10 0
expect fx11 106
expect fx14 1
expect fx15 64
expect jr_format 9
expect journey 2
expect scene 2
expect room1 64
expect halo2 64
expect dmotion0 41
expect dmotion3 25
expect tide0 64
expect tide1 24
expect pan1 64
expect sway1 0
expect slot1 1
expect jr_playing 1
expect clips 0
